{
  "slug": "architecture-studio",
  "name": "Architecture Studio",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Description:\n\nArchitecture Studio is a Claude plugin system for architects, designers, and AEC professionals. It includes 7 autonomous agents, 36 skills, 6 rules, and 3 hooks organized into 9 installable plugins — covering site research, NYC property due diligence, zoning envelope analysis, workplace programming, CSI specifications, sustainability (EPD parsing and comparison), FF&E product research, and presentation generation.\n\nA single entry point (`/studio`) routes users to the right agent or skill based on natural language. Agents orchestrate multiple skills, exercise judgment, and hand off to each other across the project lifecycle. Skills ship with bundled reference data — NYC Zoning Resolution chapters, IBC occupancy load factors, workplace benchmarks, and Uruguay zoning regulations.\n\nKey features:\n\n- `/studio` smart router — describe your task, get routed automatically\n- 7 agents with handoff logic (site planner → zoning expert → workplace strategist → materials researcher → FF&E designer → sustainability specialist → brand manager)\n- Modular install — users pick the plugins they need\n- 6 always-on rules governing units, code citations, disclaimers, CSI formatting, terminology, and output structure\n- MIT licensed, open source",
  "longDescription": "Ships **46 skills**, **7 agents** and **3 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (46): `color-palette-generator` (Create an HTML color palette from a mood, description, or image, with swatches, color codes, pairings, and contrast…), `csv-to-sif` (Export a project's FF&E product-library CSV as dealer-system SIF), `demographics-analysis` (Research population, income, age, housing, and employment around a site), `environmental-analysis` (Research climate, sun, flood, seismic, soil, contamination, and topography for a site), `epd-compare` (Compare EPD products on normalized GWP and other impacts while checking declared units, system boundaries, and LEED eligibility), `epd-parser` (Extract GWP, life-cycle stages, certifications, and impact metrics from an EPD PDF), `epd-research` (Search for EPDs by product category, CSI division, or material type — finds EPDs from EC3, program operator…), `epd-to-spec` (Write CSI specification language for EPD submittals and sourced GWP limits), and 38 more\n- **Agents** (7): `brand-manager` (Creative director for deliverables), `ffe-designer` (FF&E designer and schedule manager), `nyc-zoning-expert` (NYC property and zoning specialist), `product-and-materials-researcher` (FF&E research specialist), `site-planner` (Senior site planning consultant), `sustainability-specialist` (Sustainability consultant for building materials), `workplace-strategist` (Workplace strategy consultant)\n- **Hooks** (3): `SessionStart`, `PostToolUse`, `PreToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install architecture-studio@claude-community` from `AlpacaLabsLLC/skills-for-architects`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
